   "text": "One morning Ali ran hop-skip-jump to his cubby. Oh! The apple card wasn't there. Ali felt so sad. He got a lump in his throat. He took a deep breath. “Ela, my card is lost!” he called. Ela looked: “Zeynep's zero and Deniz's drum are gone too!”",
